15
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:40,222
The fisherman immediately sealed the lid.

16
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,520
Now the prisoner begged for release.

17
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,900
The fisherman had reversed their positions with

18
